  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Abayuda bose bafata Uziya, yari afise imyaka icumi n’itandatu, bamwimika ngo abe umwami mu gishingo ca se Amaziya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni we yasanuye Elati ahagarukana i Buyuda, umwami Amaziya amaze guhamvya ba sekuruza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya yari afise imyaka icumi n’itandatu igihe yaba umwami, hanyuma aganza imyaka mirongo itanu n’ibiri ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Yekoliya, w’i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akora ivyo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko se Amaziya yakora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arondera Imana mu gihe ca Zakariya, kuko ari we yamwigishije kwubaha Imana. Mu gihe cose yarondeye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", na we yamuhaye kuroranirwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aja kugwanya Abafilisitiya, asenyurira hasi inzitiro z’i Gati, i Yabune n’i Ashidodi. Maze aca yubaka ibisagara vyari hafi y’i Ashidodi n’ahandi hose mu Bafilisitiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imana imufasha kugwanya Abafilisitiya n’Abarabu baba muri Guri-Bayali, n’Abameyunimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamoni bazanira Uziya amashikanwa yo kumwisaba, maze aba rurangiranwa gushika ku rubibe rwa Egiputa, kuko yabaye umunyenkomezi bihebuje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya yubaka iminara i Yerusalemu kw’Irembo ryo mu Mfuruka, yubaka iyindi kw’Irembo ryo mu Kiyaya no mu mfuruka z’uruzitiro, arayikomeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yubaka kandi iminara mu bugaragwa, yimba n’ibinogo vyo kubika amazi vyinshi, kuko yari afise imikuku myinshi mu tubande no mu kiyaya. Yari afise abantu bamukorera mu mirima no mu nzabibu ziwe mu misozi no mu matongo amera cane y’i Karumeli, kuko yakunda uburimyi cane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya yari afise ingabo zigishijwe neza kugwana, zama ziteguye kuja ku rugamba ziri mu mice nk’uko ibitigiri vyabo vyari vyaharuwe mw’iharura ryagizwe na Yeyiyeli umunyamabanga, na Mayaseya umukuru w’ingabo, barongowe na Hananiya, umwe mu bakuru bakorera i bwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igitigiri c’abakuru batwara amazu bari barongoye ingabo cari ibihumbi bibiri n’amajana atandatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bari barongoye ingabo zingana ibihumbi amajana atatu n’indwi n’amajana atanu bigishijwe ivy’intambara, kandi bakomeye bo gufasha umwami kugwanya abansi biwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya ategura inkinzo, amacumu, inkofero, amakoti yo gukingira igikiriza, imiheto n’amabuye atereshwa umugozi bikwiye ingabo zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I Yerusalemu akora imashini zahinguwe n’abahinga zo gukoreshwa n’abagwanira ku minara no mu mfuruka zo kurasamwo imyampi, hamwe no gutera ibibuye bininibinini. Aramenyekana cane hose kuko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yamufashije, gushika aho yabaye agakomeye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko amaze kuba agakomeye, ubwibone bwiwe bumuzanira kuranduka. Ata ubwizigirwa k’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yiwe, maze yinjira mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ngo aturire ibimota neza ku gicaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azariya umuherezi n’abandi baherezi b’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " mirongo umunani barinda cane baramukurikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baramwubahuka, bamubwira bati: “Ewe mwami Uziya, si vyiza ko wewe uturirira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ibimota neza. Ivyo ni ivy’abaherezi, abo mu ruvyaro rwa Aroni, barobanuwe ngo baturirire ibimota neza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Sohoka uve ahera kuko wataye ubwizigirwa, kandi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana ntazobigushimira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya, yari afise icotezo mu ntoke yiteguye guturira ibimota neza, aca arashavura. Agishavuriye abo baherezi imbere yabo n’imbere y’igicaniro c’ivyo bimota neza, mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", imibembe imufatira aho nyene, iboneka mu ruhanga rwiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azariya umuherezi mukuru n’abandi baherezi bose bamuravye, babona atonzweko n’imibembe mu ruhanga, baca bihuta kumusohora hanze. Kandi na we nyene yihuta gusohoka, kuko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari amukubise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami Uziya agumana imibembe gushika ku musi yapfiriyeko. Aba mu kazu ka wenyene; kuko yari umunyamibembe, kandi ntiyemererwa kuja mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Yotamu umuhungu wiwe aca aba ari we azezwa ikirimba, yongera atwara abantu bo muri ico gihugu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
