        },
        {
          "text": "Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Uziya, uhereye ku ntango ugashitsa ku mpera, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yesaya mwene Amozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.22",
