          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Uziya arapfa, ahamvya ba sekuruza; ahambwa hafi yabo, mu rindi tongo ryari iry’abami, kuko abantu bavuga bati: “Yari umunyamibembe.” Maze Yotamu umuhungu wiwe amusubirira ku ngoma.",
          "type": "text",
